      "effect": "The public fetch API propagates each registry response budget into the owned HTTP transport. Decoded response chunks are checked during reading and the stream/client close on success, oversized body, redirect and read failure. Parent fully consumes100 controlled chunks before rejection; repaired read stops after at most3. No invalid response creates a revision or observation. Exact-size valid controlled bodies preserve content SHA and revision. HTTP redirects remain unfollowed. EgressBlockedError now yields denied/outbound_policy_denied with advisory_only/no execution. Existing authored direct streaming/denial tests join the cohort with a bounded mock-domain scope that works under an already-created strict guard. Six new boundary cases,69total focused/API/security passes,one separate opted-live protocol execution; no existing committed test body changed.",
